# a skill that passes
$ skills lint <WORLD>/good/SKILL.md
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---

# a skill that does not
$ skills lint <WORLD>/bad/SKILL.md
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
[lint:frontmatter-fence] file does not start with a `---` frontmatter fence

# a file that is not there
$ skills lint <WORLD>/missing.md
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: reading "<WORLD>/missing.md": open <WORLD>/missing.md: no such file or directory

# a directory
$ skills lint <WORLD>/a-directory
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: reading "<WORLD>/a-directory": read <WORLD>/a-directory: is a directory

# a link
$ skills lint <WORLD>/link.md
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---

# a path with no name
$ skills lint 
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills lint requires a path or --rules

